! luna-scout.md — research, 2026-11-09

Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/placement-scout/luna-scout.md` (research, file date 2026-11-09); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/placement-scout/index]].

